msgstr "Dependências do Pidgin"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:72
#, xml-text
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Exigidas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:74
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref linkend=\"gtk2\"/>"
msgstr "<xref linkend=\"gtk2\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gstreamer10\"/> (required for"
" audio support), and <xref linkend=\"gnutls\"/> or <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"nss\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gstreamer10\"/> (exigido para"
" suporte de áudio) e <xref linkend=\"gnutls\"/> ou <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"nss\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#.  <xref linkend="tcl"/>
#. ,
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"avahi\"/> (required for the Bonjour plugin), <xref "
"linkend=\"cyrus-sasl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"dbus\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"doxygen\"/>, <xref linkend=\"evolution-data-server\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"graphviz\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libidn\"/> (required, if you wish to"
" run the test suite), <xref linkend=\"libnsl\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>, <xref linkend=\"sqlite\"/> (required for the "
"Contact Availability Prediction plugin), <xref linkend=\"startup-"
"notification\"/>, <xref linkend=\"tk\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Farstream\"> "
"Farstream</ulink> (required for video and voice support), <ulink "
"url=\"https://gtkspell.sourceforge.net/\">Gtkspell</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://libgadu.net/\">libgadu</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://keep.imfreedom.org/libgnt/libgnt\">libgnt</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://meanwhile.sourceforge.net/\">Meanwhile</ulink> (required for "
"Sametime protocol support), <ulink url=\"https://www.mono-"
"project.com/\">Mono</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"http://silcnet.org/client.html\">SILC Client</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"http://silcnet.org/client.html\">SILC Toolkit</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://packages.debian.org/stable/source/zephyr\">Zephyr</ulink>, and"
" <xref linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> (required for Kerberos support in the Zephyr "
"module)"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"avahi\"/> (exigido para o plugin Bonjour), <xref linkend"
"=\"cyrus-sasl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"dbus\"/>, <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"evolution-data-server\"/>, <xref linkend=\"graphviz\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"libidn\"/> (exigido, se você desejar executar a suíte de "
"teste), <xref linkend=\"libnsl\"/>, <xref linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"sqlite\"/> (exigido para o plugin Contact Availability "
"Prediction), <xref linkend=\"startup-notification\"/>, <xref linkend=\"tk\"/"
">, <ulink url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Farstream\"> "
"Farstream</ulink> (exigido para suporte de vídeo e voz), <ulink url=\"https"
"://gtkspell.sourceforge.net/\">Gtkspell</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://libgadu"
".net/\">libgadu</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://keep.imfreedom.org/libgnt/"
"libgnt\">libgnt</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://meanwhile.sourceforge.net/\""
">Meanwhile</ulink> (exigido para suporte do protocolo Sametime), <ulink url="
"\"https://www.mono-project.com/\">Mono</ulink>, <ulink url=\"http://silcnet."
"org/client.html\">Cliente SILC</ulink>, <ulink url=\"http://silcnet.org/"
"client.html\">SILC Toolkit</ulink>, <ulink url=\"https://packages.debian.org/"
"stable/source/zephyr\">Zephyr</ulink> e <xref linkend=\"mitkrb\"/> (exigido "
"para suporte Kerberos no módulo Zephyr)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional (runtime)"
msgstr "Opcionais (tempo de execução)"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:128
#, xml-text
msgid "<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/>"
msgstr "<xref role=\"runtime\" linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Pidgin"
msgstr "Instalação do Pidgin"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Compile <application>Pidgin</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Compile o <application>Pidgin</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --with-gstreamer=1.0 \\\n"
"            --disable-avahi      \\\n"
"            --disable-gtkspell   \\\n"
"            --disable-meanwhile  \\\n"
"            --disable-idn        \\\n"
"            --disable-nm         \\\n"
"            --disable-tk         \\\n"
"            --disable-vv         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --with-gstreamer=1.0 \\\n"
"            --disable-avahi      \\\n"
"            --disable-gtkspell   \\\n"
"            --disable-meanwhile  \\\n"
"            --disable-idn        \\\n"
"            --disable-nm         \\\n"
"            --disable-tk         \\\n"
"            --disable-vv         &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> installed (<xref "
"linkend=\"graphviz\"/> can be used also) and you wish to create the API "
"documentation, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver o <xref linkend=\"doxygen\"/> instalado (<xref "
"linkend=\"graphviz\"/> também pode ser usado) e desejar criar a documentação"
" da API, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:165
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make docs</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make docs</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:168
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:175
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -pv /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v README doc/gtkrc-2.0 /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"mkdir -pv /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -v README doc/gtkrc-2.0 /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you created the API documentation, install it using the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você criou a documentação da API, instale-a usando os seguintes comandos "
"como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;/api</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -pv /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;/api &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/pidgin-&pidgin-version;/api</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-gstreamer=1.0</parameter>: Remove this switch and add "
"<option>--disable-gstreamer</option> if you've not installed <xref "
"linkend=\"gstreamer10\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-gstreamer=1.0</parameter>: Remova essa chave e adicione "
"<option>--disable-gstreamer</option> se você não tiver instalado o <xref "
"linkend=\"gstreamer10\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-avahi</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've "
"installed <xref linkend=\"avahi\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-avahi</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"avahi\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-gtkspell</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've "
"installed <ulink url=\"https://gtkspell.sourceforge.net/\">Gtkspell</ulink> "
"and wish to enable spellchecking support."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-gtkspell</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <ulink "
"url=\"https://gtkspell.sourceforge.net/\">Gtkspell</ulink> e desejar "
"habilitar o suporte à verificação ortográfica."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-meanwhile</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've "
"installed <ulink "
"url=\"https://meanwhile.sourceforge.net/\">Meanwhile</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-meanwhile</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <ulink "
"url=\"https://meanwhile.sourceforge.net/\">Meanwhile</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:220
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-idn</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've installed"
" <xref linkend=\"libidn\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-idn</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"libidn\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-tk</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've installed "
"<xref linkend=\"tk\"/> and you wish to use the TCL bindings."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-tk</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"tk\"/> e desejar usar as ligações TCL."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-nm</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've installed "
"<xref linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-nm</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"NetworkManager\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-vv</parameter>: Remove this switch if you've installed "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Farstream\"> "
"Farstream</ulink> and wish to enable voice and video communication support. "
"You should also remove the --disable-gstreamer flag."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-vv</parameter>: Remova essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/Farstream\">Farstream</ulink>"
" e desejar habilitar o suporte de comunicação de voz e vídeo. Você também "
"deveria remover o sinalizador --disable-gstreamer."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-cyrus-sasl</option>: Use this switch if you've installed "
"<xref linkend=\"cyrus-sasl\"/> and wish to build "
"<application>Pidgin</application> with SASL support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-cyrus-sasl</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver instalado"
" o <xref linkend=\"cyrus-sasl\"/> e desejar construir o "
"<application>Pidgin</application> com suporte SASL."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-gnutls</option>: Use this switch if you've got both <xref "
"linkend=\"gnutls\"/> and <xref linkend=\"nss\"/> installed, but want to use "
"<xref linkend=\"nss\"/> for the SSL support."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-gnutls</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"gnutls\"/> e <xref linkend=\"nss\"/> instalados, mas quiser usar o"
" <xref linkend=\"nss\"/> para o suporte SSL."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Pidgin"
msgstr "Configurando o Pidgin"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:261
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:263
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>~/.purple/*</filename> and <filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>~/.purple/*</filename> e <filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:268
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.purple/*"
msgstr "~/.purple/*"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:272
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.gtkrc-2.0"
msgstr "~/.gtkrc-2.0"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:276
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/xsoft/other/pidgin.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Most configuration can be accomplished by using the various preference "
"settings inside the programs. Additionally, you can create a "
"<filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename> file which can store gtk+-2 theme settings"
" that affect <application>Pidgin</application> and other Gtk+ 2 "
"applications. Note that an example <filename>gtkrc-2.0</filename> file was "
"installed during the package installation and can be used as a starting "
"point or reference."
msgstr ""
"A maior parte da configuração pode ser realizada usando-se as diversas "
"configurações de preferência dentro dos aplicativos. Além disso, você pode "
"criar um arquivo <filename>~/.gtkrc-2.0</filename> que pode armazenar "
"configurações do tema gtk+-2 que afetam o <application>Pidgin</application> "
"e outros aplicativos Gtk+ 2. Observe que um exemplo de arquivo "
"<filename>gtkrc-2.0</filename> foi instalado durante a instalação do pacote "
"e pode ser usado como ponto de partida ou referência."

